    "body": "Correction: relaunching the editor cannot fix this. The current page does not provide an editable amount beside each honor action, which is what this issue requests. It exposes 21 action toggles and a separate editor for Rockstar's 19 shared magnitude tiers. The prior automated checks only proved that the separate tier table existed in the DOM; they did not prove that each action had an amount control. The earlier explanations about page scroll and stale rendering were therefore wrong. Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#161 remains actionable until the action list itself exposes meaningful editable amounts, or the engine limitation is explained and resolved without substituting a different UI.",
